  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Intern styrning och kontroll ISK av Solidarity Committee for Afghanistan</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Internal control review of Solidarity Committee for Afghanistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">During the spring of 2025, Sida launched a call for proposal for Swedish civil society
organisations for project support between 1 and 5 M SEK per year. Solidarity Committee for Afghanistan has submitted an application which is currently undergoing review by Sida. Since Sida need more information about the internal control of Solidarity Committee for Afghanistan, a decision has been taken to contract a consultant to perform an assessment based on these terms of reference.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Under v&#xe5;ren 2025 utlyste Sida projektst&#xf6;d p&#xe5; mellan 1 och 5 miljoner kronor per &#xe5;r till svenska civilsamh&#xe4;llesorganisationer. Solidarity Committee for Afghanistan har l&#xe4;mnat in en ans&#xf6;kan som f&#xf6;r n&#xe4;rvarande granskas av Sida. Eftersom Sida beh&#xf6;ver mer information om organisationens interna kapacitet anlitar Sida konsultst&#xf6;d. Detta avropas p&#xe5; rangordnat ramavtal.</narrative>
  </description>
